      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried giving him some apple juice earlier but he just spit it back out. i'm really nervous about him getting weak. i read online that if you put a little bit of salt in his water it helps the body absorb it faster? like a homemade electrolyte drink? how much salt should i actually put in a bottle for a 2 year old so it's effective but safe? i dont want to go to the hospital if i can just fix this here.",
