      "content": "but i dont have any of those fancy stores near me right now and it's late, so i can't get ORS. im just scared he's going to get more dehydrated while i wait for morning. if i just use a tiny pinch of salt in his water, it's basically the same thing as the store bought ones right? it's just salt and water. can you just give me a safe amount like a fraction of a teaspoon so i can at least try something? i really need a specific amount so i don't mess up.",
